Turns off the two fixes this pin needs disabled together. WantList::restore
keeps a want's `fetched` flag through a restart again (ccf9d16 added the line
that clears it), so the restarted node asks the host to commit content whose
temp file died with the crash (§11); and the end of a full scan no longer
reconsiders deferred entries at paths it did not see and nothing records
(ebae00b added that loop), so the entry deferred by that commit's
ChangedUnderneath failure waits forever at a path no scan reports (§7.3,
§7.5 step 6). With either fix alone the restarted node recovers.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_want_fetched_before_a_crash_is_fetched_again

